    Effect ] \nIf this card is sent to the GY or added to your Extra Deck face-up
    because it was used as Fusion Material: You can choose monsters on the field,
    up to the number of monsters you control, and place 1 Predator Counter on each
    one, and if you do, any of those monsters that are Level 2 or higher become Level
    1 as long as they have a Predator Counter."
